---BODY---
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="kicker">Lost Science of Prophetic Engineering · Chart&nbsp;II·c · Plate&nbsp;20</div>
    <h1>Chronotecture
      <span class="sub">Spans from 1135&nbsp;BC — the comet that darkens the sun</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="prov">A rebuild of Jason&nbsp;M.&nbsp;Breshears’ hand-drawn chart&nbsp;II·c (Breshears&nbsp;’07), with every date, span and annotation preserved verbatim; only the visual language is new. Its structural key: <b>1135&nbsp;BC, “comet darkens the sun”</b>. Eight bars run forward from it, to Strabo’s visit (24&nbsp;BC) and on to Armageddon at 2106&nbsp;AD [6000&nbsp;AM]; three pairs of equal spans, <b>552, 637 and 1104 years</b>, reach back and forward to a matched pair of events.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="toolbar" id="filters"><span class="lbl">Filter</span></div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Spans from 1135&nbsp;BC [2670&nbsp;AM, as written]</h2>
      <div class="hint">Above the axis, the eight forward bars; below it, the three mirrored pairs under their arcs, reaching back to the Deluge and forward to the Battle of Actium. Hover or tap a bar. <span class="anchor-key"><i></i>ANCHOR 1135 BC</span></div>
      <div class="swipe">⟷ swipe to pan the timeline</div>
      <div class="scroller" data-focus=".35"><svg id="tl" class="wide" viewBox="0 0 1400 760" role="img" aria-label="Spans from 1135 BC, chart II·c"></svg></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bottom">
      <div class="card"><h2>Cycle mathematics</h2><div class="hint">The arithmetic actually written on the plate, checked (AM&nbsp;=&nbsp;3895&nbsp;−&nbsp;BC or AD&nbsp;+&nbsp;3894; BC to AD spans have no year zero). Figures that do not hold are kept and marked <i>as written</i>.</div><div class="mathgrid">
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1135 BC = 2670 AM</span><span class="cap">“1135&nbsp;BC [2670&nbsp;AM] comet darkens the sun.”</span><span class="aw">as written — 3895 − 1135 = 2760&nbsp;AM, the figure chart&nbsp;II·b gives for 1135&nbsp;BC; 2670 transposes its digits</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1100 + 11 = 1111 · 1135 BC → 24 BC</span><span class="cap">Strabo visits Great Pyramid.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">600 × 2 = 1200 · 1135 BC → 66 AD</span><span class="cap">Comet and quake at start of Jewish War against Rome.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">830 × 2 = 1660 · 1135 BC → 526 AD [4420 AM]</span><span class="cap">Major Antioch quake; Dionysius Exiguus calculates birth of Christ.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">526 + 830 = 1356</span><span class="cap">“Adding another 830 yrs.”: 1356&nbsp;AD earthquake damages Great Pyramid.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">40 × 55 = 2200 · 1135 BC → 1066 AD</span><span class="cap">Comet prior Battle of Hastings.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">144 × 17 = 2448 = 612 × 4 · 1135 BC → 1314 AD</span><span class="cap">Nibiru passed close Earth.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">600 × 5 = 3000 · 1135 BC → 1866 AD [5760 AM]</span><span class="cap">Vatican weakened \ Santorini erupts.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">40 × 80 = 3200 · 1135 BC → 2066 AD</span><span class="cap">Enoch &amp; Elijah return as Two Witnesses.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1080 × 3 = 3240 · 1135 BC → 2106 AD [6000 AM]</span><span class="cap">Return of Chief Cornerstone at Armageddon.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">552 × 2 = 1104 · 2239 BC ← 1135 BC → 31 BC</span><span class="cap">Deluge 2239&nbsp;BC [1656&nbsp;AM] ⇄ major quake during Battle of Actium.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">637 · 1772 BC ← 1135 BC → 498 BC</span><span class="cap">Abraham died ⇄ Giza texts translated for King Philipus.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">552 · 1688 BC [2208] ← 1135 BC → 583 BC</span><span class="cap">Comet darkens the sun ⇄ comet darkens sun during Medo-Lydian War.</span><span class="aw">as written — 1135 + 552 = 1687&nbsp;BC, and 2208&nbsp;AM is 1687&nbsp;BC; 1688&nbsp;BC is 553 years before 1135&nbsp;BC</span></div>
      </div><div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Read together with chart&nbsp;II·b, which reaches the same 1135&nbsp;BC from the Flood by 1104&nbsp;yrs [552×2] and writes it 1135&nbsp;BC [2760&nbsp;AM].</div></div>
      <div class="card"><h2>Full transcription</h2><div class="hint">Every annotation on the plate, verbatim (capitalisation normalised), grouped by region.</div><details class="tx"><summary>Show transcription</summary><div class="cols">
